<%# locals: (site_name:, contact:) — the About page a new site opens with.
    Deliberately claim-free: it says only what is true of any brand-new site,
    so it reads as real copy until the author replaces it with their story. %>
<h1>About <%= site_name %></h1>

<p><%= site_name %> is where new releases, works in progress, and the notes that go with them are posted first.</p>

<p>If you'd rather have them by email, the newsletter goes out when there's something worth sending — no more often than that, and you can leave any time.</p>

<p>Questions, review copies, or anything else: <%= contact %>.</p>
